ce36852d8a505389b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello, Toto-san!\n\nI saw your appeal and I would be honored if you drew Kalija. I did make a couple changes--her hair being more curly and flowy and it is also white now. However, I don't mind if you do the purple. \n\nShe's cheerful and adventurous who always wears a smile. I'm okay with any outfit and hairstyle as well. I really like to be surprised. \n\nThank you so much for the consideration! ^^\n\nReferences:\nUpdated look: \nhttps://imgur.com/a/xenbyRZ\nhttps://imgur.com/a/BYgC2Vs\nhttps://imgur.com/a/s1gJPkF\n\nOlder References:\nhttps://imgur.com/a/yS4YZI6\nhttps://imgur.com/a/49KjqZr", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@yukkuriarctttt/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f6a448bd/uploads/origins/32c483e0-0da0-472f-b30f-0a5fa1a93f29?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=150f8d2b51909ac23cecca63605e9f79", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f6a448bd/uploads/origins/32c483e0-0da0-472f-b30f-0a5fa1a93f29?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=150f8d2b51909ac23cecca63605e9f79, https://si.imgix.net/f6a448bd/uploads/origins/32c483e0-0da0-472f-b30f-0a5fa1a93f29?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=52b0f0adba2eccd5ceb3d3387f5766f2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f6a448bd/uploads/origins/32c483e0-0da0-472f-b30f-0a5fa1a93f29?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dc5818fd9ff96bb69eb76eb11f8e426c 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Thank you so much for your interest in Sehya! I would absolutely love for you to draw her! \nShe is a cool, mysterious, and mature woman who is often described as secretive. She is an informant always ready for a fight, but I would love to see your idea of her in a \n\nThank you for your consideration!\n\nhttps://imgur.com/TTIT396", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@yukkuriarcttt